    "category": "Stack",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "A ramp is a pair of indices (i, j) such that i < j and nums[i] <= nums[j]. Find the maximum width of a ramp in the array, where the width is j - i. Return the maximum possible width.",
